    "---\n",
    "title: \"Publications\"\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "419e0032",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This is a list of my academic publications. It just pulls from my ORCID, and as such does not reflect any preprints, and may be behind. You can also find my publications on my google scholar [profile](https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&user=AEkfk_QAAAAJ&view_op=list_works&sortby=pubdate)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Publications"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "537b2562",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/markdown": [
       "**Directed energy deposition additive manufacturing: Microstructure and composition engineering for high-performing metallic materials** (2026). *Additive Manufacturing*. <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.addma.2026.105240>\n",
       "\n",
       "**A second-generation apparatus for in situ synchrotron characterisation of directed energy deposition additive manufacturing with multi-modal monitoring and external forces** (2026). *Materials & Design*. <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matdes.2026.115495>\n",
       "\n",
       "**Mechanical and in situ thermal-related behavior upon directed energy deposition additive manufacturing of a high-performance Al alloy** (2026). *International Journal of Extreme Manufacturing*. <https://doi.org/10.1088/2631-7990/ae3349>\n",
       "\n",
       "**Angular-dependent interatomic potential for large-scale atomistic simulation of iron: Development and comprehensive comparison with existing interatomic models** (2021). *Physical Review Materials*. <https://doi.org/10.1103/physrevmaterials.5.063607>"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 2,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: false\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "from IPython.display import Markdown\n",
    "\n",
    "orcid_id = \"0000-0002-0509-2755\"\n",
    "\n",
    "url = f\"https://pub.orcid.org/v3.0/{orcid_id}/works\"\n",
    "headers = {\"Accept\": \"application/json\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n",
    "\n",
    "works = response.json()[\"group\"]\n",
    "works = sorted(works, key=lambda w: w[\"work-summary\"][0][\"publication-date\"][\"year\"][\"value\"] if w[\"work-summary\"][0][\"publication-date\"] else \"0\", reverse=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "lines = []\n",
    "for work in works:\n",
    "    summary = work[\"work-summary\"][0]\n",
    "    title = summary[\"title\"][\"title\"][\"value\"]\n",
    "    year = summary[\"publication-date\"][\"year\"][\"value\"] if summary[\"publication-date\"] else \"n.d.\"\n",
    "    journal = summary[\"journal-title\"][\"value\"] if summary[\"journal-title\"] else \"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    doi = \"\"\n",
    "    for eid in summary.get(\"external-ids\", {}).get(\"external-id\", []):\n",
    "        if eid[\"external-id-type\"] == \"doi\":\n",
    "            doi = eid[\"external-id-value\"]\n",
    "            break\n",
    "\n",
    "    if doi:\n",
    "        lines.append(f\"**{title}** ({year}). *{journal}*. <https://doi.org/{doi}>\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        lines.append(f\"**{title}** ({year}). *{journal}*\")\n",
    "\n",
    "Markdown(\"\\n\\n\".join(lines))"
   ]
  }
 ],
